  "instructions": [
    "1. Cut the lamb shoulder into thin strips and season with salt, black pepper, and zatar.",
    "2. Grill or pan-fry the lamb until tender and slightly charred.",
    "3. Warm the flatbread by wrapping it in foil and heating it in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "4. Assemble the shawarma by spreading a layer of lamb on each flatbread piece.",
    "5. Top with chopped onion and parsley (if using).",
    "6. Drizzle with lemon juice and serve immediately.",
    "7. Serve with additional flatbread on the side for dipping in the juices."
